| storage-eager = 0
| storage-lazy = 1
| storage-getter = 2

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ TypeProperty is Struct

` A property of a type, its own or one it takes from a class above. One a facet of the class
` declares has the facet's place among the program's facets as `facet`, and others none.

+ name Atom
+ storage-kind StorageKind
+ slot U32
+ type TypeId = no-type
+ owner TypeId = no-type
+ facet U32 = U32.max


